2152
01:24:44,537 --> 01:24:46,977
This is kind of like the Park Sae Ro Yi hair.

2153
01:24:48,307 --> 01:24:49,307
He's right.

2154
01:24:49,707 --> 01:24:50,947
Your mom is frowning.

2155
01:24:52,577 --> 01:24:55,416
Both of them love dramas.

2156
01:24:55,417 --> 01:24:57,946
So my dad wanted to visit the places...

2157
01:24:57,947 --> 01:25:00,186
