2160
01:25:03,287 --> 01:25:05,327
My mom also wanted to wear hanbok...

2161
01:25:05,427 --> 01:25:07,957
and go to Gyeongbokgung.

2162
01:25:08,027 --> 01:25:10,196
But she hasn't been able to do that either.

2163
01:25:10,197 --> 01:25:12,167
So this year, I want to take them around...

2164
01:25:12,427 --> 01:25:15,696
