2165
01:25:15,697 --> 01:25:18,907
Helping them do so is one of my goals for this year.

2166
01:25:19,537 --> 01:25:20,976
You should bring them here.

2167
01:25:20,977 --> 01:25:22,637
I know. They should visit you here.

2168
01:25:23,007 --> 01:25:25,007
I should get back.

2169
01:25:25,547 --> 01:25:28,117
- All right. Hang in there. - Yes.

2170
01:25:29,317 --> 01:25:33,516
