2183
01:26:04,717 --> 01:26:06,347
Professionally and personally.

2184
01:26:06,957 --> 01:26:08,277
I think you'll live well happily.

2185
01:26:08,787 --> 01:26:10,157
She really is the Human Vitamin.

2186
01:26:10,287 --> 01:26:12,927
We'll root for your life in Korea, Tsuki!

2187
01:26:13,087 --> 01:26:14,796
- Thank you! - You got it!

2188
01:26:14,797 --> 01:26:16,226
(We'll root for you!)

2189
